---An item subgroup. Item subgroups are the rows in the recipe list in the player's inventory GUI. The subgroup of a prototype also determines its item [group](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemGroup.html%23group#group) (tab in the recipe list).
---
---The built-in subgroups can be found [here](https://wiki.factorio.com/Data.raw#item-subgroup). See [ItemPrototype::subgroup](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemPrototype.html%23subgroup#subgroup) for setting the subgroup of an item.
